    "name": "Codrops",
    "descriptionZh": "2009 年起更新的前端创意技术站，分 All Posts、Creative Hub、Webzibition、Case Studies、Tutorials 和三类 Spotlights，教程都配可运行 demo。",
    "takeawayZh": "跟 Three.js 教程抄一份能跑的 demo",
    "noteZh": "首屏是一组彩色大卡：左边 Creative Hub 写着 a growing showcase of Codrops originals and hand-picked demos from the creative web，中间是头条 Making the Internet a Bit Less Sh*t: Inside Resn's Digital Experiences by resn，右边两块紫卡分别是 Creative Spotlights 与 Studio Stories。导航只有 All Posts、Creative Hub、Webzibition 三个，Webzibition 自称收了两千多个站点。近期文章标题几乎都在讲技术：Building an Infinite Liquid Glass Grid with Three.js, WebGPU, and TSL、Still: From Akira to Ink Wash, Building a Generative Garden in WebGPU。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
